# can't see before the server starts. Empirically, ctx=12288 (688 MB KV) leaves only
# ~1.3 GB headroom on Orin Nano 8 GB and crashes under load. ctx=8192 (448 MB KV)
# leaves ~1.6 GB — safe for all models on this hardware. Raise only if a future model
# profile is tested stable at a higher value.
